{
  "name": "Electro-Harmonix Big Muff Pi Ram's Head Violet",
  "version": 3,
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "category": "Pedals / Fuzz",
  "description": "1973 V2 first Violet variant, with four silicon stages, two diode-feedback clipping stages, and the original asymmetric tone network. Uses 2N3904-MiSTer models as substitutes for FS36999. The audio path is drawn in its engaged state. Source: https://www.bigmuffpage.com/images/schematics/KR_1973_V2_Violet_Schematic_1st_version.jpg",
